      "notes": "v19 canary measured ~USD 0.45 per Codex/Local Terminal-Bench run on gpt-5.6-sol; gpt-5.6-terra lists at 40% of those rates (2/0.2/12 against 5/0.5/30), giving ~USD 0.18 per Codex run. Multi spawn overhead is modelled at 3x. Gate 1 is modelled at USD 3.20 per attempt."
