    "run_slots": 116,
    "notes": "Point estimate is the 20 base runs plus one successful gate 1 attempt. The USD 67.80 worst schedule-shape prediction adds 40 conditional effective runs, 40 infra attempts priced as the dearer Multi side, all six gate 1 attempts, and one attribution diagnostic per task. It is not a legal spend ceiling: token usage may cost more. The cumulative reservation/settlement hard stop remains USD 120.00. Run slots are 60 effective + 40 infra + 6 gate 1 + 10 diagnostics = 116."
  },
